{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1000_p", "source_sha256": "00747a40c6fa139a5255e0dcc172046c5476b9ce9ff29535ee438642465fb015", "ja": "美也、ライブお疲れさま。\n演出もばっちり決まって、盛り上がったな！", "zh": "美也，演唱会辛苦了。\n演出效果也完美呈现，现场气氛很热烈啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "07bc5122dda7b03c2f9c336909e60b84396d3e81f91a20406bb755bed7207322", "ja": "はい～。しゅわしゅわの泡がいっぱいのライブで、\nお客さんたちも、楽しそうでしたね～。", "zh": "是呀～。这场演出充满了咕嘟咕嘟的泡沫，客人们看起来也很开心呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "e4070f1b55e8a98e918f5ae1533ee0065157ad3b886d89214f77416b90d788e0", "ja": "そういえば～……今日のライブで、私、\nすごいことに気がついてしまいました～。", "zh": "对了～……我在今天的演唱会上，发现了一件不得了的事情～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "3ee30a0b0695df3bea83f60ed122c945831301aa4bf63b190ee691be5eec336f", "ja": "ラムネとシャボン玉って、とっても\n似ているんですね～。これは、大発見ですよ～。", "zh": "弹珠汽水和肥皂泡，原来非常相似呢～这可是重大发现哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3e99a9d7fa836c093684cd334001fad2861a850205a8e5f2f8fa5102582bbf4c", "ja": "ラムネとシャボン玉……？", "zh": "弹珠汽水和肥皂泡……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "4859493457176b97212a4e6708ec0f6bfbaefafe0a2a9b35e3c359dc2d407f7d", "ja": "はい～。泡でできたシャボン玉に、まつりちゃんや\n朋花ちゃん、お客さんたちの笑顔が映ってたんです～。", "zh": "是的～。在泡沫做成的肥皂泡里，映出了小祭、小朋花和客人们的笑脸～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "449480ac78018a891a757f7450d3f32706f5d0729dd21934a76db578a3d0c0b1", "ja": "ラムネのビー玉にも、映り込んだりしますよね～？\nなので、似ているな～と思いまして～。", "zh": "弹珠汽水里的玻璃珠上，也会映出倒影吧～？\n所以我就觉得，和那个很像呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1007_p", "source_sha256": "858c77d0e1291d6a16f6d06eaa1181772d9cfcd65ef1b25d5bec06ff60354ba7", "ja": "ああ、なるほど……いわれてみれば確かに。\n形も同じ球体だもんな。", "zh": "啊，原来如此……你这么一说，确实挺像的。\n形状也都是球体嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "6186cbf0426bc9e2851f37a33ebf171f6f18d398989dbcef2314a20664c3b65e", "ja": "はい～。笑顔でいーっぱいの、素敵なライブにできて、\n一安心……おや～？", "zh": "是呀～。能办成一场充满笑容的精彩演出，总算可以放心了……哎呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1009_p", "source_sha256": "154738e371b30d4b2d39838ada34b87c4ad12ba2dd66c62b48b76490f5e19782", "ja": "ん？　美也、どうした？\n……って、うわっ。", "zh": "嗯？美也，怎么了？\n……呃，哇。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "b6c13285bba5d912cd07ac93d3edfa80ee19601fe09815f87215e10457199f4b", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ちょっといいですか～？\n……ふんふん、これは……おお～！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，可以打扰一下吗～？\n……嗯嗯，这个是……喔喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "7d16134191e43ef6d373ac3ddd1cf2f9e71bb110c4f563641ac05e5d87efe3aa", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、ビー玉みたいに\n澄んだ、とっても綺麗な目をしていますね～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生也是呢，这双眼睛像弹珠一样\n澄澈，非常漂亮呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a449fbfaa587593bb70b248dfe04f53f288a84c97feebc730a8891d004c2cc01", "ja": "あ、ありがとう、美也。褒めてくれるのは\n嬉しいけど、ちょっと近いかな……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢你，美也。你夸我我很高兴，不过……是不是有点太近了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "efd345ad0d456c6af90cec086406914bb41289f7bd94a2f9ed1e450ef6d0c939", "ja": "おお……失礼しました～。何が映り込んでいるの\nかな～と、気になってしまいまして～。", "zh": "哦……失礼了～因为我有点在意，刚才到底映出了什么呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "b62879a5105121e53bc3a39c6f8c37e3653498f55ed65a41f6e2355cf2ef3ec0", "ja": "けど、近くで覗きすぎたせいでしょうか～。\n私の顔しか、見えませんでした～。ふふふ。", "zh": "不过，是不是因为我凑得太近了呢～  \n结果只能看到我的脸～呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e89c386e19b2f156ee8a4f39d1f84f5f546ffa9f8343f0c0c76b5df92ea9aacd", "ja": "うん、そうだろうな……。", "zh": "嗯，应该是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "e21698e519dcc6dbe848b83e5b9a82aef038ef5b533903669ca4a67e2ea77308", "ja": "今日のライブ、{$P$}さんの目に、\nみんなの笑顔は、ちゃんと映っていましたか～？", "zh": "今天的演出，{$P$}先生的眼里，\n大家的笑容都有好好映照出来吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1017_p", "source_sha256": "611a42f369081402c33bf1a02a3fa4dd010efb7c6aa35a311668abd81f97c57b", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。ファンのみんなはもちろん、まつりや\n朋花、そして美也の笑顔も、目に焼き付いているぞ。", "zh": "啊，当然。粉丝们的笑容自不用说，连茉莉、朋花，还有美也的笑容，也都深深印在我的眼中了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "d5e5f7a37a11f4bbd48e4ffb3a7d69f676db387299a46088e407f4cc440f1297", "ja": "それなら良かったです～。焼き付いた思い出は、\nちょっとやそっとでは、落ちませんからね～。", "zh": "那就太好了～。铭刻在心的回忆，可不是轻易就能忘掉的呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "e1ff3ab9e468dc23f24f62ada95fb6192a4301848950758cb7cd811b06f60ab3", "ja": "私もきっと、これから何度でも、\n今日のことを思い出すと思いますよ～。", "zh": "我以后肯定也会一次又一次想起今天的事哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1020_p", "source_sha256": "73aab593b59ca1f1dfcf63f396255b94944d8b40ffaebf26389bab7f4ab20086", "ja": "かけがえのない思い出になったみたいで、良かったよ。\nこれからももっと、増やしていこうな！", "zh": "看来已经成为一段无可替代的回忆了，真是太好了。\n今后也一起创造更多回忆吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1021_042miy", "source_sha256": "b1fca926a57ed23fe3033c31642cf25234175ad49789cf4d5d35809334ef2a30", "ja": "はい～。ひと夏だけでなく、ひと秋ひと冬ひと春、\nたくさんの思い出を作っていきたいです～。", "zh": "是的～。不只一个夏天，我也想在一个又一个秋冬春里，创造许许多多的回忆～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0174_1022_042miy", "source_sha256": "3cdfaa6cbe0b76d31d8fcfea9a1ada4cbddbf8131e8e13a8a362e03df571272c", "ja": "{$P$}さん、これからも\n私たちを、見守っていてくださいね～。ふふふ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，今后\n也请继续守护我们哦～。呵呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
